# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# updateRunDB
# ===========
#           
# Usage:   cd .../mu3eanca/perl
#          ./updateRunDB
#
# Options:  -d     debug, nothing is updated
#           -n X   do at most X updates
#           -r X   do run X only
#
# History 
#         2026/11/18 only the last 100 runlog names are considered
#         2026/11/17 blacklist a run after 3 unsuccessful uploads
#         2026/10/16 start with 2026, add single run capability
#         2025/05/16 add upload of DataQuality and RunInfo attributes
#         2025/05/06 migration of path
#         2025/05/01 migration of path
#         2025/04/01 add -f 
#         2025/03/26 first shot
